    "Id": "chassisdef_rifleman_RFL-C3",
    "Name": "Rifleman",
    "Details": "The Rifleman C 3 are completely constructed from scratch, unlike the Rifleman C retrofit of the RFL-3N, which pair integrated cutting-edge technology with classic styling. With its dual Ultra AC/5 and twin Extended-Range Large Lasers main armament, the C 3 is perfect for garrisoning duties. The combination of Ferro-Fibrous armor with CASE II and Endo Steel structure also allows adding two Extended-Range Medium Lasers for close range protection and a total of 14 heatsinks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
